msgstr "Talk_Yes"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Haruka"
msgid "You're going back to Kamurocho, aren't you?"
msgstr "Volverás a Kamurocho, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Kiryu"
msgid "Haruka, I..."
msgstr "Haruka, Yo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Haruka"
msgid "I just don't get it, Uncle Kaz. How can you trust him so\\r\neasily?"
msgstr "Simplemente no lo entiendo, tío Kaz. ¿Cómo puedes confiar en él tan\\r\nfácilmente?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Haruka"
msgid "He stabbed you in broad daylight, Uncle Kaz! You almost died!"
msgstr "¡Te apuñaló a plena luz del día, tío Kaz! ¡Casi te mueres!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Haruka"
msgid "I'll never trust him... Never in a million years."
msgstr "Nunca confiaré en él... Ni en un millón de años."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Kiryu"
msgid "Haruka, please."
msgstr "Haruka, por favor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Haruka"
msgid "Whenever I see him, I just think back to what happened last\\r\nyear. What he did to you."
msgstr "Siempre que lo veo, solo pienso en lo que pasó el año pasado. En lo que te hizo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Haruka"
msgid "That memory terrifies me, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Esa memoria me aterra, tío Kaz."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Kiryu"
msgid "Haruka..."
msgstr "Haruka..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Haruka"
msgid "I've always believed in you. You know I have."
msgstr "Siempre he creído en ti. Sabes que lo he hecho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Haruka"
msgid "But this time... I'm really worried."
msgstr "Pero esta vez... estoy realmente preocupada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Haruka"
msgid "It feels like if you go to Tokyo now, you're never gonna\\r\ncome home."
msgstr "Siento que sí vas a Tokio ahora, nunca volverás a casa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Kiryu"
msgid "You heard us talking last night, huh?"
msgstr "Nos escuchaste hablar anoche, ¿eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Haruka"
msgid "Maybe you want to know what happened five years ago, but I\\r\ndon't care one way or another. I just want you to be safe."
msgstr "Puede que quieras saber lo que pasó hace cinco años, pero a\\r\nmi no me importa para nada. Solo quiero que estés a salvo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Kiryu"
msgid "You don't care? Haruka, you lost both your parents in that\\r\nincident."
msgstr "¿No te importa? Haruka, perdiste a tus padres en ese\\r\nincidente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Kiryu"
msgid "I lost Nishiki and Kazama-san."
msgstr "Perdí a Nishiki y a Kazama-san."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Kiryu"
msgid "If there really was something more going on behind the\\r\nscenes, wouldn't you want to know what it was?"
msgstr "Si realmente hubiera algo más detrás de\\r\nescenas, ¿no te gustaría saber de qué se trataba?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Haruka"
msgid "I... I'm happy just being here with you, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Yo... Estoy feliz de estar aquí contigo, tío Kaz."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Haruka"
msgid "That's all I need. Not the truth... Just you."
msgstr "Lo único que necesito. No es la verdad... Solo eres tú."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Kiryu"
msgid "Haruka..."
msgstr "Haruka..."

